# UniFi Manager MCP

Go MCP server for UniFi Site Manager (multi-site).

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Copilot instructions under `.github/` remain for other tools.

## Conventions

- Prefer env / `.env.example` for Site Manager API credentials
- Keep tool handlers thin; share client code across site/host/device tools
- Do not commit live credentials
